Miniature XL 1.2
Based on Miniature Shader 2.19 by Mateus A. Kreuch, used under the MIT License
reproduced below. Modifications (Miniature XL): selective glow/bloom pipeline,
voxel flood-fill colored lighting (Overworld, Nether, End), entity and dropped
item lights, sky/sun color settings, day-night shadow rework, native Voxy
LOD integration (voxy.json shader patch), resource pack lava recoloring,
per-material emissive glow masks (lightness-ranked, nether stem veins, Photon-
like nether portal), glow ink and calibrated sculk sensor glow, sun & moon
glow toggle, water edge fade at the LOD boundary, entity shadow fade,
quality profiles.

